<title>FRANCE: Alcatel, up eight pct, hits year high.</title>
<headline>Alcatel, up eight pct, hits year high.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom shares rallied by nearly 10 percent to set a year high at 674 francs after its 1996 results and news conference.</p>
<p>At 1355 GMT, Alcatel was up 8.97 percent at 668 francs.</p>
</text>
